omx-plugins (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.8.0: dependencies are a floor only; version and changelogs
  * param contract: OMX_CLAP_UNIT_LUFS = 0x103 joins the vendor block (#140)
  * Library dependencies are a floor only: no ceiling in the spec,
    debian/control or omxplugins.pc
  * ci: the shared release workflow also reads the run it reports on
    (actions: read)
  * ci: the dry-run job allows the issue-opening step of the shared release
    workflow
  * release: allow the shared workflow to open an issue when a release fails

